## 1. Purpose

This policy sets Contoso Demo Bank small and medium enterprise (SME) lending limits.

## 2. Scope

Applies to working-capital, term, and revolving facilities to SME borrowers. Construction SME facilities also follow CP-CND-2026-01.

## 3. Thresholds

- Maximum SME facility is {{ facts.max_sme_facility }}.
- A personal guarantee is required above {{ facts.personal_guarantee_threshold }}.
- Working-capital maximum tenor is {{ facts.working_capital_max_tenor }}.
- Sector concentration cap is {{ facts.sme_sector_concentration_cap }} of the SME book per NAICS 2-digit code.
- Minimum years in operation is {{ facts.min_years_in_operation }}.

## 4. Authority

Regional Credit Officer SME limits are in Delegated Credit Authority (CP-AUTH-2026-01).

## 5. Related policies

See Documentation (CP-DOC-2026-01) and Delegated Credit Authority (CP-AUTH-2026-01).
